1
00:00:00,267 --> 00:00:03,417
Job hunting already feels
like a full-time job.

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:04,850
Twelve tabs open.

3
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:06,860
Rewriting the same resume.

4
00:00:06,900 --> 00:00:07,580
Again.

5
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:10,630
Then you upload it… and
type it all in anyway.

6
00:00:12,100 --> 00:00:13,690
So, meet SpotApply.

7
00:00:14,700 --> 00:00:18,890
It checks company career pages, and
finds roles that fit your background.

8
00:00:21,133 --> 00:00:24,123
Tap one, and see why it
fits: the skills you match,

9
00:00:28,767 --> 00:00:29,797
and the gaps.

10
00:00:31,200 --> 00:00:35,050
Then it tailors your resume and cover
letter to the role, using your real

11
00:00:35,070 --> 00:00:36,200
experience.

12
00:00:41,133 --> 00:00:44,913
On the job's form, the extension
fills the fields it supports.

13
00:00:46,667 --> 00:00:47,957
You check every answer.

14
00:00:47,977 --> 00:00:49,147
You click Submit.

15
00:00:49,800 --> 00:00:51,730
Less time on repetitive work.

16
00:00:51,820 --> 00:00:54,220
More time on meaningful applications.

17
00:00:54,400 --> 00:00:56,300
Make your next application count.
